# Galactic BH viz — agent memory

Read and update `MEMORY.md` when changing the page, galaxy viz, physics constants, controls, or shortcuts.

## Done means committed

When a user-facing change is finished (not mid-debug):

1. Update `MEMORY.md` if behavior or conventions changed.
2. Commit with a short why-focused message (HEREDOC).
3. Push to `origin` on `main` unless the user says otherwise.

Do not commit `verify/`, `.env*`, or secrets. Keep the site as a single self-contained `index.html` unless the user asks to split it.
